@startuml document_processing_sequence
skinparam shadowing false
title Document processing — PDDL workflow

actor User
participant "Frontend\n(Web/Telegram/CLI)" as Front
participant "REST API / Worker\nbackend/api" as API
participant "Processing Service\nbackend/service.py" as Service
participant "PddlAccessibilityOrchestrator" as Orchestrator
participant "Acessilia Toolbox" as Toolbox
participant "PlannerAgent" as Planner
participant "Executor (Agno Workflow)" as Executor
participant "Vision / Data Agents" as Agents
participant "Canonical Builder / Validators" as Builder
participant "Renderers / Exporters" as Export

User -> Front: Submit document
Front -> API: Upload and enqueue
API -> Service: process(input_path, mode)
Service -> Service: Register task and check cache
Service -> Orchestrator: executar(input_path, temp_dir)
Orchestrator -> Toolbox: Extract structure
Toolbox --> Orchestrator: Processing manifest
Orchestrator -> Agents: Enrich eligible images and tables
Agents --> Orchestrator: Structured results
Orchestrator -> Planner: Generate and validate PDDL plan
Planner --> Orchestrator: Validated plan
opt execute_dry_run enabled
  Orchestrator -> Executor: Validate plan in dry-run mode
  Executor --> Orchestrator: Execution report
end
Orchestrator --> Service: Processed payload
Service -> Builder: Build and validate canonical document
Builder --> Service: Canonical document
Service --> API: Processing result
API -> Export: Render accessible formats
Export --> API: Output artifacts
API --> Front: Status and download links
Front --> User: Accessible documents
@enduml
